      "content": "Redistribution and UBI are big moves that could actually cause more instability in the short term if the tax burden hits the industrial leaders too hard. I'm worried about the market's reaction to those specific policies. Can you walk me through exactly how you'll manage the information flow during this transition? I want to make sure we aren't inadvertently causing panic or feeding the volatility.",
